WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A circle is on the screen. Keep your eyes on the cross.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Steady looking is not a perfect recording.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
An observer may stop reporting a peripheral detail.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The historical observation dates to 1804.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Stimulus and experience answer different questions.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
